      "title": "Boy, 13, charged with murder after man stabbed to death in Sydney’s west",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/12/boy-13-charged-mt-druitt-stabbing-death-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Second boy, 16, also charged in relation to the stabbing death of a 30-year-old man in Mount Druitt</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>A 13-year-old boy has been charged with murder after a man was stabbed to death in Sydney’s west on Friday.</p><p>Emergency services were called to the suburb of Mount Druitt on Friday evening amid reports a man had been assaulted.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/12/boy-13-charged-mt-druitt-stabbing-death-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
